llama_layer_e2e: TinyLlama layer, 64 tokens after a 64-token cache (causal over 128 keys), D=2048 F=5632, 32 heads / 4 kv heads, all stages on MxGemmini
key blocks: first 64, last 64, middle 128
attn_flash: E4M3, Sq=128 Sk=128 d=64, Bk=128 (2 key blocks), online softmax on the VPU, K/V resident
mask: causal (each head's queries are the last keys)
mesh order: QK(j+2) before PV(j)
vector order: softmax(j+1) before PV(j); loads, update(j-1), SR(j+1) after it
softmax: fused EXPSUM (exp(S - m) and its row sums in one pass)
spad layout: bank split, stats in bank 2 (banks 0-1 only mesh operands)
1/sqrt(d): folded into Q's scales (no VPU pass)
